exports[`NSW cutover and data migration (golden) > the cutover client with a draft cutover > executed 1`] = `"<div class="space-y-6"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Cutovers</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Each scheme is cut over once. Start one, stage its files, check them, sign off, then run it.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:items-end"><div class=""><label for="source" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Source system</label><select id="source" name="source" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white"></select></div><div class=""><label for="newCutoverDate" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Cutover date</label><input id="newCutoverDate" type="date" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="newCutoverDate" value=""/><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">The balances are as at the end of this day.</p></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-white border-[1.5px] border-turquoise text-turquoise hover:bg-turquoise/5 focus:ring-turquoise " type="button">Start a cutover</button></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">StrataMax cutover</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Executed 02/10/2026, 12:00:00 am.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:items-end"><div class=""><label for="cutoverDate" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Cutover date</label><input id="cutoverDate" type="date" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors bg-white" name="cutoverDate" value="2026-06-30"/></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Files</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">CSV files, parsed and checked on the server. The SHA-256 of each file is kept and signed off.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-5"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Opening trial balance<span class="text-red-500"> *</span></p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Every account&#x27;s balance at the cutover date: debit and credit columns, or one signed balance. It must net to zero.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Outstanding levy notices</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">One row per unpaid notice, with its original due date, so interest and ageing carry on correctly. Interest the old system charged is counted as already charged.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Unpaid supplier invoices</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Invoices approved in the old system but not fully paid. Suppliers must be set up first.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Owner credit balances</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Levies paid in advance, by lot and fund.</p></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink">Bank reconciled balances</p><p class="text-xs text-ink-muted">Each bank account&#x27;s last reconciled statement balance and date.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Checks</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">The opening trial balance must net to zero. Each control account is compared with the detail behind it.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-4 text-sm"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted">Debits</p><p class="tabular-nums text-ink">$0.00</p></div><div><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted">Credits</p><p class="tabular-nums text-ink">$0.00</p></div><div><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted">Difference</p><p class="tabular-nums font-semibold text-red-700">$NaN </p></div></div><ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-red-700"><li>Add the opening trial balance.</li></ul></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Sign-off</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Records who signed off, when, the source system, the cutover date, the SHA-256 of every file and each difference acknowledged.</p></div></div><div class="space-y-3"><div class=""><label for="note" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Note (optional)</label><textarea id="note" name="note" placeholder="For example: balances agreed to the StrataMax trial balance printed 1 July 2026." rows="3" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors resize-y"></textarea></div><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise " disabled="" type="button">Sign off the cutover</button></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Run</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Posts the opening trial balance and creates the brought-forward notices, invoices, owner credits and bank reconciled balances, all at once. It runs once per scheme.</p></div></div><p class="text-sm text-ink">Done: journal entry JE-0001 with 4 lines, 2 levy notices, 1 invoices, 1 owner credits and 1 bank accounts.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-red-700">This scheme has no funds yet. Set up the funds and chart of accounts first.</p></div></div>"`;

