quoise hover:bg-mint-soft/50 border-line bg-white"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">StrataMax</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">Import data from StrataMax with support for their standard export formats.</p></button><button type="button" class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border-2 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:border-turquoise hover:bg-mint-soft/50 border-line bg-white"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">MYOB</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">Import chart of accounts and opening balances from MYOB AccountRight or Essentials.</p></button><button type="button" class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border-2 p-5 text-left transition-colors hover:border-turquoise hover:bg-mint-soft/50 border-line bg-white"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Xero</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">Import chart of accounts and opening balances from Xero accounting.</p></button></div></div></div></div>"`;

