<div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide">Uploaded</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink">—</dd></div></dl></div></div><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Linked Records</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Financial records associated with this document.</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-3"><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">No linked records. This document can be linked to a lot, supplier, invoice, levy notice, or bank transaction.</p></div></div></div><div class="space-y-6"><div class="rounded-[var(--radius-card)] bg-white border border-line p-6 "><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4"><div><h2 class="font-heading font-semibold text-base text-ink">Review</h2><p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-0.5">Review this document and update its status.</p></div></div><div class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-4"><div><label for="reviewNotes" class="block text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1.5">Review Notes</label><textarea id="reviewNotes" name="reviewNotes" placeholder="Optional notes about this document..." rows="3" class="w-full rounded-[var(--radius-card)] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-ink placeholder:text-ink-muted focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-turquoise focus:border-turquoise transition-colors resize-y"></textarea><p class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-ink-muted">Add notes before approving or rejecting.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 h-10 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:pointer-events-none bg-turquoise text-white hover:bg-turquoise/90 focus:ring-turquoise ">Approve</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center